    {
      "id": "ehp9v77",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "4.2.3 Punjab Agricultural University (PAU)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3khlc3e",
      "content": "Punjab Agricultural University (PAU), Ludhiana, established in 1962, played a pivotal role in the Green Revolution. It is one of the top agricultural universities in Asia. Key contributions include development of HYV seeds, fertilizer recommendations, and farm mechanization."
    },
